ements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"code":"ListItemComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"borders (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), colors (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), opacities (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and dimensions (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic"}}}